            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Board of Education shall establish and maintain a Section 125 plan, which includes premium conversion and medical reimbursement and dependent care assistance flexible spending accounts, provided that the medical reimbursement flexible spending account shall be offered only to unit members enrolled in either an HMO or in the new POS managed care plan.",
